## Commands

Run `make help` to see all available commands.

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `make install` | Install dependencies |
| `make build` | Build contracts |
| `make test` | Run tests |
| `make test-v` | Run tests with verbosity |
| `make snapshot` | Update gas snapshot |
| `make gas` | Show gas report |
| `make coverage` | Run coverage |
| `make lint` | Check formatting |
| `make fmt` | Format contracts |
| `make clean` | Clean build artifacts |

## Conventions

- **Framework**: Foundry (forge, cast, anvil)
- **Formatting**: `forge fmt` (Solidity style guide)
- **Testing**: Foundry tests in `test/` with `.t.sol` suffix
- **Scripts**: Deploy scripts in `script/` with `.s.sol` suffix
- **Docs**: NatSpec comments for all public functions
